   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Threshold has no valid policy, performance, or fiduciary conditions associated with it or any of its activities as the funding for the program is entirely managed by the Millennium Challenge Corporation (MCC). Throughout the course of the four-year program, MCC will manage and disburse the Grant in accordance with the terms of the agreement. The Program Agreement provides additional information on the reason for this funding arrangement and relevant terms of the grant.</narrative>
